  "description": "Large file uploads to Azure Blob Storage for ASP.NET Core 3.1-10 and classic ASP.NET (MVC 5, WebForms, Web API 2 on .NET Framework 4.6.2+). Two lines of setup (AddLargeFileUploader + MapLargeFileUploader; Web.config only on classic ASP.NET) serve an upload API and a ready-made drag & drop browser uploader: files go to Azure in chunks with automatic retries, resume after a network drop, and per-file progress and cancel. Files up to ~244 GB; the storage key stays on the server.",
  "frameworkAssemblyGroup": {
